# Keeps the build context small and the build reproducible from the checkout.
# `client/` itself MUST stay in: the image builds the web client from it.
# ⚠️ Patterns match from the context ROOT; `**/` for anything nested
# (worktrees under .claude/ are full checkouts, node_modules included).
.git
.github
**/.claude
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
client/dist
client/dev-dist
# Docs-only changes must not invalidate the client build layer (only the
# client's vitest suite reads these, never `yarn build`).
client/docs
client/*.md
dist-client
dist
build
wheelhouse
# Overwritten by the build from the client stage anyway; a stale local copy
# must not even look like it could end up in the image.
src/aivinnet/client.zip
# Data directories of a local/CI run (the Docker smoke test creates these).
config
music
tests
tests_api
docs
*.png
